56
00:05:04,400 --> 00:05:08,400
Editing multiple layers of clothing has become easier now.

57
00:05:08,400 --> 00:05:12,400
For example, if you want to edit the vest under this lady's shirt,

58
00:05:12,400 --> 00:05:15,400
