60
00:05:19,400 --> 00:05:24,400
then click the isolation selection icon at the bottom of the 3D vertical menu bar,

61
00:05:24,400 --> 00:05:27,400
or directly press the Shift and I shortcut keys.

62
00:05:27,400 --> 00:05:30,400
The 3D window will only display the content you selected,

63
00:05:30,400 --> 00:05:34,400
so that you can fully focus on the inner layer of clothing without being disturbed by any visual interference.

64
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:39,400
This way, you can quickly and intuitively adjust the inner layer of clothing,

65
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:43,400
